    <string name="novabird_ai_local_title">Compute on the phone</string>
    <string name="novabird_ai_local_enable">Semantic search on the phone</string>
    <string name="novabird_ai_local_enable_note">Also without Helper, e.g. on the go. Downloads 320 MB once on Wi-Fi.</string>
    <string name="novabird_ai_local_with_helper">While a Helper is paired, it computes the vectors. If it is not reachable (e.g. away from home), the phone computes the search queries; after a day without the Helper, the phone also catches up on new messages while charging.</string>
    <string name="novabird_ai_local_hint_title">Compute on the phone?</string>
    <string name="novabird_ai_local_hint_text">Without Helper the phone computes the vectors itself. This takes about half a second per message, so it only runs while charging. The model needs 320 MB of storage and about 500 MB of memory while loaded.</string>
